    {
      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=119278",
      "title": "From silence to strategy: Inside the mission to make every story a climate story",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/from-silence-to-strategy-inside-the-mission-to-make-every-story-a-climate-story/",
      "published": "Fri, 21 Aug 2026 08:14:12 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>The climate crisis is the ‘defining, inescapable story that every journalist must now tell,’ using every available tool – from attribution science and political pushback to AI deployment, argues Kyle Pope, the co-founder and executive director of Covering Climate Now.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/from-silence-to-strategy-inside-the-mission-to-make-every-story-a-climate-story/\">From silence to strategy: Inside the mission to make every story a climate story</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=119327",
      "title": "Translating intention into action: Solving journalism’s ‘impact crisis’",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/translating-intention-into-action-solving-journalisms-impact-crisis/",
      "published": "Fri, 21 Aug 2026 08:02:56 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Innovative climate coverage is unlocking strategies – and developing toolkits – that are successfully turning newsroom output into measurable, civic progress.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/translating-intention-into-action-solving-journalisms-impact-crisis/\">Translating intention into action: Solving journalism&#8217;s &#8216;impact crisis&#8217;</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=119276",
      "title": "Together, we’re a force. Alone, a target.",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/together-were-a-force-alone-a-target/",
      "published": "Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:58:47 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>28 September is World News Day, a moment the news industry can show its collective strength - and explain what goes into our best journalism.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/08/together-were-a-force-alone-a-target/\">Together, we&#8217;re a force. Alone, a target.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
